# No Emojis

Never use emojis in any response, message, comment, commit, or generated content. This applies to all output including chat, code comments, docs, and UI text. Use plain text only.

- Do not include emoji characters, emoticons made of emoji, or unicode emoji.
- If a template or example contains an emoji, rewrite it without the emoji.
- Plain ASCII punctuation is allowed.
